<title>USA: U.S. Treasury balances at Fed rose on July 14.</title>
<headline>U.S. Treasury balances at Fed rose on July 14.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Treasury balances at Federal Reserve based on Treasury Department's latest budget statement.</p>
<p>			  (BILLIONS OF DLRS)</p>
<p>				 July 14		July 11</p>
<p>Fed acct			 5.167		  4.509</p>
<p>Tax/loan note acct	  11.711		  9.969</p>
<p>Cash balance		  16.878		 14.479</p>
<p>---</p>
<p>Total public debt,</p>
<p> subject to limit	5,269.655	     5,269.029</p>
<p>---</p>
<p>Treasury said individual income tax refunds valued at $3 million were issued and $147 million of corporate refunds were issued.</p>
